  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK revision av CONCORD Sverige 2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Control Review ISK of CONCORD Sweden 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assignment is made by Sida&apos;s initiative and consists of an audit of CONCORD Sweden as no such has been done before and Sida has recently entered into a new agreement with them, the assignment will focus on an analysis of CONCORD&apos;s internal control system to determine if these can guarantee quality and accuracy.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppdraget g&#xf6;rs av Sidas initiativ och best&#xe5;r av en revision av CONCORD Sverige d&#xe5; ingen s&#xe5;dan gjorts innan och Sida nyligen ing&#xe5;tt i nytt avtal med dem, uppdraget kommer att fokusera p&#xe5; en analys av CONCORD:s interna styrsystem f&#xf6;r att avg&#xf6;ra om dessa kan garantera kvalitet och noggrannhet.</narrative>
  </description>
